    "When you leave a playing tab, its video moves into the sidebar player. Automatic Picture in Picture turns off while this is on." : {
      "comment" : "Caption under the Show video in the player row on the Experiments settings page, and the caption of that same row in Settings search. The video only moves while the user is on a different tab, and turning this row on turns the Automatic Picture in Picture row off. “Picture in Picture” is the macOS name of the floating video window — use the system’s own wording. Two full sentences."
    },
    "Where downloaded files are saved." : {
      "comment" : "Caption describing the Save files to setting in the Settings search results. A sentence fragment."
    },
    "Whether Linen is your default browser." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Open links from other apps row, shown only in the Settings search results. Linen is the application name and is never translated. Sentence case with a final full stop."
    },
    "Whether updates arrive on releases, or early on preview builds." : {
      "comment" : "Detail line for the Update channel row in the Settings search results. Covers both choices, because the search index cannot know which one is set."
    },
